    "created_at": "2016-08-22T07:16:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-22T07:16:58Z",
    "body": "In this case, it is up to the hardware (& service/app) vendor to provide sufficient encryption in their inner protocols if the solution requires it.  If they make everything open, it's the same problem as with all other comms hardware.\n",
